<title>CHINA: Shanghai exchange extends trading 30 minutes.</title>
<headline>Shanghai exchange extends trading 30 minutes.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai stock exchange extended trading of A shares, funds and treasury bonds by 30 minutes on Friday because of technical problems on the trading system, exchange officials said. B share trading finished as usual at 1500 local time, while trading of the other instruments finished at 1530, they said without elaborating.</p>
